=====================================
           MAP HELP
=====================================


::MAP BASICS::
-------------------------------------
New Map: Add tab (default 48x24).
Openings: 7-digit (0-5); edges + center.
  - 0=none, 1=open, 2=door, 3=unit (rope/hole/ladder), 4=non-interactive, 5=waypoint.
Width/Height: 0-1080; apply resizes.
Type: Safe/Crawl/Fight/Mix0-3/Mixed.
Name: Title (max 28 chars).
Maker: Creator (max 21 chars).
System: Auto "PB [no-jam] PyEditor".


::SYMBOL PLACEMENT::
-------------------------------------
Select: From list; left-click place.
Select Mode: -- for props/multi-select.
Right-Click: Remove (to space)/select.
Multi-Select: Drag; edit region.
Lock Apply: Auto-apply on matches.


::PROPERTIES::
-------------------------------------
Color: Symbol text color.
Texture: Visual string.
Name: Custom.
Value: Integer (0+).
Depth: Integer (1+).
Height: Integer (1+).
3D: Checkbox for depth.
Apply: To cell/region; menu clear.


::EDIT OPERATIONS::
-------------------------------------
Copy/Cut/Paste: Region.
Replace: Symbols to current.
New Map: From region.
Clear Props: Reset in region.
Remove: Clear symbols/props.
Undo/Redo: Grid changes.


::ARCS INTEGRATION::
-------------------------------------
Attached: Green dots; click to load.
Load to Map: Attach.
Save from Map: Export attached.


::FILE OPERATIONS::
-------------------------------------
Save .tmap: Single map + props/arcs.
Save .mapd: Dict with imports + arcs.
Load .tmap/.txt: Single.
Load .mapd: Multi-maps + arcs.


::DOOR CONNECTIONS::
-------------------------------------
Use symbols: +=Door, -=Non-Interactive, L=Ladder, H=Hole, R=Rope, Q/I=Waypoints.
Follow door.guide for exit->entrance.
Waypoints: Q (home, many connects), I (instance, 1 connect).

=====================================
  !See symbols/phrases for options!
=====================================
